{"title": "Legendary Action: Soul Ascension", "pageid": 30384, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Ascension", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Utility.webp, /w/images/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Legendary_Action_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Soul Ascension</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> while he <em>is</em> in his <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Ascension\" title=\"Fiendish Ascension\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp/25px-Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp/38px-Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp/50px-Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fiendish Ascension\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp/25px-Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Fiendish_Ascension_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Ascension\" title=\"Fiendish Ascension\">Fiendish Ascension</a> form. It lets him expend a legendary action to use <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Ascension\" title=\"Soul Ascension\">Soul Ascension</a>, after he or his allies are attacked.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Raphael can spend a Legendary Action to immediately cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Ascension\" title=\"Soul Ascension\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Ascension\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Ascension\" title=\"Soul Ascension\">Soul Ascension</a> when he or his allies are attacked. \n</p><p>Raphael may use this Legendary Action as many times per round as there are Soul Pillars standing at the start of the round.\n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Soul_Ascension\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Soul Ascension </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Ascension_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Soul Ascension (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Soul Ascension\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Ascension_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Soul Ascension (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Soul Ascension</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Raphael can spend a Legendary Action to immediately cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Ascension\" title=\"Soul Ascension\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Ascension\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Ascension\" title=\"Soul Ascension\">Soul Ascension</a> when he or his allies are attacked.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202949\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1272/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11901/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4883/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 